{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "Hooba Windows game activity detection",
  "matching_rules": [
    "Compare process executable names case-insensitively.",
    "Prefer the actual game process; launcher and anti-cheat processes are not reliable game-active signals.",
    "Some entries are marked verify because executable names can change by build, store, or launcher.",
    "Do not infer a game from generic processes such as javaw.exe without checking command line or install path.",
    "An executable can be shared by multiple games; resolve ambiguous names using full executable path or Steam app ID.",
    "The server skips a process when its title contains \"do not\", \"ambiguous\", \"not a reliable\", \"not the match\", \"not ideal for detection\", or the word \"launcher\".",
    "A trailing parenthetical note (verify, possible, variant, and similar) is omitted from the shown title. A name such as DOOM (2016) is kept."
  ],
